  "descriptionHtml": "<p data-end=\"224\" data-start=\"163\"><strong data-end=\"224\" data-start=\"163\">2023 G3 Guide V167 Like New &amp; Fully Rigged for Fishing!</strong></p><p data-end=\"372\" data-start=\"226\">Used only once, this 2023 G3 Guide V167 is in <em data-end=\"282\" data-start=\"272\">pristine</em> condition and comes loaded with premium features and upgrades - just turn the key and fish!</p><ul>\t<li data-end=\"780\" data-start=\"374\"><strong data-end=\"409\" data-start=\"376\">Brand new Humminbird Helix 10</strong> for advanced sonar and GPS navigation</li>\t<li data-end=\"780\" data-start=\"374\"><strong data-end=\"470\" data-start=\"452\">MinnKota i-Pilot GPS Trolling motor</strong>&nbsp;(70 lb. 24v) with remote installed for quiet, controlled movement</li>\t<li data-end=\"780\" data-start=\"374\"><strong data-end=\"529\" data-start=\"516\">2 anchors</strong>&nbsp;with anchor caddy and <strong data-end=\"547\" data-start=\"534\">4 bumpers</strong> included for easy docking and mooring</li>\t<li data-end=\"780\" data-start=\"374\"><strong data-end=\"613\" data-start=\"590\">Plush seat cushions</strong> and <strong data-end=\"648\" data-start=\"618\">2 movable captain's chairs</strong> for comfort and flexibility</li>\t<li data-end=\"780\" data-start=\"374\"><strong data-end=\"694\" data-start=\"681\">Live well</strong>, <strong data-end=\"709\" data-start=\"696\">rod cubby</strong>, <strong data-end=\"744\" data-start=\"711\">multiple fishing pole holders</strong>, and <strong data-end=\"767\" data-start=\"750\">ample storage</strong> throughout</li></ul><p data-end=\"928\" data-start=\"782\">Whether you're a seasoned angler or just getting started, this G3 is turnkey-ready with everything you need to hit the water in style and comfort.</p><p data-end=\"1014\" data-start=\"930\"><strong data-end=\"1014\" data-start=\"930\">Why wait for new? Get a like-new boat with all the upgrades no add-ons required!</strong></p>",
